      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\",\"(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\",\"(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\",\"(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:e3b5c49381ea4ec75d9e204582e90e3be31ad10ba043e8a08a52827fdaa94756\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ba15e0666f11da9003a3a59261faa73753966fa5813150c6dcf16f074cede5eb\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:9cbfe9eb763aea54393152af648544026a49c75f53fbdb8e944b4a133aafcf90\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:dab3550da061c30ddea25c74154339b611776205ad37eecb97eace6fb686b9a7\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4a6dc4931efad6c1ac06409c67e6841a3aec76617429b7fb77e85bc7cf762a06\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a1d235232b7ba7318cbf27e5b4df1b5eac1f54f0bbbfe52f930f85a28ba5cdf8\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b99f5dde6940e3a573bf3ec14ae76e050d2e4b9c8083d139cb9193bc880a39ea\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:9984d26a717bd38f2e738d2763c362ecea31c21ff7222b900baed587cd6072a3\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:dbe65bcd0f1b812313efd63a34d5f6d672f942222dd4162e29bf5112b4eeeba4\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:35c688f8886207d1541197f14cba143e21c7620a9e307a4297dedfd2c104cb0d\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"choice_text\":\"All of the following conditions must be satisfied: the passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded; the firearm is unloaded; the firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and the container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":2010,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:2010:sha256-55445821b85174dd35baccbe029635bc4b535d4c2fb27e8faef334a78e47a106\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:2010:sha256-55445821b85174dd35baccbe029635bc4b535d4c2fb27e8faef334a78e47a106\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1623:2010:sha256-5e6ee9c0f0ef7f3bf66dbc94704a549b91e1a2b158c1563ceaf58dfc6a4815e9\",\"quote\":\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1623},{\"end\":1556,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1376:1556:sha256-9dd5c9d0feb251838bff5c1a16b3c099ef083ecc7b0fca10625f4c8d5699fdf1\",\"quote\":\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\",\"start\":1376},{\"end\":1809,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1623:1809:sha256-f6fe03740da837c967d5e1a19cc83bd62f4517d0b086d968201a40859ccf0a16\",\"quote\":\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\",\"start\":1623},{\"end\":1840,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1811:1840:sha256-728d008fcfc79639161d8c2b1d0a6f86e145e04143be6ec504ef19d73771e1d6\",\"quote\":\"(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\",\"start\":1811},{\"end\":1901,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1842:1901:sha256-e6a871e22fdb4f04a0b00e20075aa0b5b737e6d1cb0fd25f4f29d5a90551bd62\",\"quote\":\"(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\",\"start\":1842},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"alternative:3\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1903:2010:sha256-8522eb345b969daa7d941fb54eecd07d2803856ad5eac836d5b26f452a52a60f\",\"quote\":\"(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1903}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:51d9213b6eca2e1bd42f1ca339fa3e9ca74b13e057eda3635122bf130e08adec\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:35c688f8886207d1541197f14cba143e21c7620a9e307a4297dedfd2c104cb0d\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:0ca255e68e3f1447e8b60637e8f8478b63e0e4a06fdd9d9c3f6ebbbb20c1a110\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"references\":[\"§ 1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:7ff6c0120a06b13414b5bcb07968bb00a05c189a2249e14839e313182a43ce0d\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\"],\"scope_text\":\"In checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter, applicable to a passenger transporting or offering for transport baggage.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1586,\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter any unloaded firearm(s) unless: (i) the passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded; (ii) the firearm is unloaded; (iii) the firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and (iv) the container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
